    <data name="PageTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Destination Rules</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PageIntro" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Tell Resgrid what a call's destination must offer, so the call form and the apps can suggest the nearest suitable one: "Burns calls need a Burn Center", "a Helicopter needs a Helipad", "a Water Tender goes to a Water Source that allows Drafting". Every rule that matches a call (and the unit travelling) applies together. Destinations are your POI types marked as destinations; capabilities are managed under POI Capabilities, and open, diversion or closed comes from Destination Availability.</value>
  </data>
