  </data>
  <data name="ModeSuggestAndFill" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Suggest and fill in the destination</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ModeHelp" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Suggest shows the best destinations under the Destination field of the New Call and Update Call forms and in the apps' destination lists, with drive time and distance. Suggest and fill also fills a new call's empty destination with the best one; dispatchers and crews can still choose another. Each suggestion looks up drive times, so leave this off if you don't use destinations.</value>
  </data>
